  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the Primary Eye Health Project through Integrated People-Centered Approach in Dhaka Division, Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Strengthening integrated eye health services based on the primary health care system  1.1 Operation of integrated eye health services at healthcare facilities   1.1.1. Support for capacity building of primary health workers for integrated Eye NCD care  1.1.2. Expansion of essential infrastructure for primary eye care services   1.1.3. Expansion of eye care services at primary healthcare facilities   1.1.4. Integration of eye screening into regular check ups for NCD patients (e.g., diabetes, hypertension) 1.1.5. Support for major eye surgeries and treatment of diabetic complications through partnerships with collaborating hospitals 1.1.6. Support for referral services  1.2 Strengthening the operational capacity of local health governance for integrated eye health services   1.2.1. Activation of the Integrated Eye Health Services Operating Committee based on the primary healthcare system  1.2.2. Support for service coordination and integration   1.2.3. Support for on-site coachin</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through a peoplecentered eye NCD integrated approach based on the primary health system, aim to contribute to reducing preventable blindness and vision impairment in Dhaka District.1. &#xC77C;&#xCC28;&#xBCF4;&#xAC74;&#xCCB4;&#xACC4; &#xAE30;&#xBC18;&#xC758; &#xD1B5;&#xD569;&#xC801; &#xC548;&#xBCF4;&#xAC74; &#xC11C;&#xBE44;&#xC2A4; &#xAC15;&#xD654; 
1.1. &#xBCF4;&#xAC74;&#xC758;&#xB8CC;&#xC2DC;&#xC124; &#xB0B4; &#xD1B5;&#xD569;&#xC801; &#xC548;&#xBCF4;&#xAC74; &#xC11C;&#xBE44;&#xC2A4; &#xC6B4;&#xC601;
1.2. &#xC9C0;&#xC5ED; &#xBCF4;&#xAC74; &#xAC70;&#xBC84;&#xB10C;&#xC2A4;&#xC758; &#xD1B5;&#xD569;&#xC801; &#xC548;&#xBCF4;&#xAC74; &#xC11C;&#xBE44;&#xC2A4; &#xC6B4;&#xC601; &#xC5ED;&#xB7C9; &#xAC15;&#xD654;</narrative>
